# Shell scripts and the automation manifest must stay LF on every platform.
#
# A CRLF automation used to parse differently in the two wrappers: the awk
# parsers compared against a bare "---" and saw "---\r", so the shell wrapper
# fell through to treating a known verb as a free-form prompt while PowerShell
# ran the real automation. The parsers now strip CR themselves; this keeps the
# files from being converted in the first place.
*.sh              text eol=lf
automations/*.md  text eol=lf
